sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Learner
  participant C as Client
  participant F as FarmPi
  participant D as MariaDB
  participant Q as Qwen
  U->>C: speak/type question
  C->>F: alternatives + preferences
  F->>F: normalise; interpret learner intent/context
  opt farm fact or action requested
    F->>D: approved query only
    F->>F: resolver / analytics / evidence
  end
  opt learning explanation useful
    F->>F: select labelled guidance/research/general knowledge
    F->>Q: facts and/or source context + provenance/uncertainty
  end
  F-->>C: concise answer, source label, chart/evidence, next learning direction
